<h2>Build Your Competitive Edge</h2>
<div class="quote">
"When you master the art of prompting your own education, you stop relying on standard curriculums and start engineering your own mastery."
</div>
<p style="margin-top:20px;">The Intelligence Network helps you move past passive consumption into active, AI-assisted self-transformation designed for high performance.</p>
</section>
</div>
